  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/07/TrobadaBandesMusicaPlanaBaixa.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>192 fotos de la XXIII Trobada de Bandes de la Plana Baixa, que s&#39;ha celebrat a Onda aquest dissabte, 1 de juliol, al Raval de Sant Josep i en la qual han participat tamb&eacute; les formacions musicals de Ribesalbes, Suera i Tales, entre d&#39;altres municipis de la comarca.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentracionbandasmusicaraval/img_6066.jpg\" alt=\"img_6066\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentracionbandasmusicaraval/img_6069.jpg\" alt=\"img_6069\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentracionbandasmusicaraval/img_6071.jpg\" alt=\"img_6071\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentracionbandasmusicaraval/img_6074.jpg\" alt=\"img_6074\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentracionbandasmusicaraval/img_6076.jpg\" alt=\"img_6076\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentracionbandasmusicaraval/img_6079.jpg\" alt=\"img_6079\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentracionbandasmusicaraval/img_6081.jpg\" alt=\"img_6081\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentracionbandasmusicaraval/img_6082.jpg\" alt=\"img_6082\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentracionbandasmusicaraval/img_6086.jpg\" alt=\"i